WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.040
The work you do in your playbook for this lesson is foundational.

00:05.040 --> 00:11.580
The values, strengths, energy patterns, and life lessons you uncover are the raw materials

00:11.580 --> 00:20.640
you will use in your next lesson to architect your M.V.P. blueprint.

00:20.640 --> 00:23.760
So don't rush this process.

00:23.760 --> 00:30.280
Give yourself space and grace to be honest and insightful.

00:30.280 --> 00:36.960
This self-discovery is the single most important investment you can make in your leadership.

00:36.960 --> 00:43.080
In the next lesson, we'll take everything you've uncovered and we will move into architecture

00:43.080 --> 00:49.680
phase where we will build your mission, your vision, and your purpose and introduce the

00:49.680 --> 00:53.580
90-Day Way system to bring it all to life.

00:53.580 --> 00:56.340
This isn't just about knowing yourself.

00:56.340 --> 01:02.160
It's about building the inner conditioning that drives the outer performance to lead

01:02.160 --> 01:06.180
through change when everything around you is uncertain.

01:06.180 --> 01:11.460
If nothing else, I hope from the stories I've shared with you, you see this.

01:11.460 --> 01:14.060
You don't build your blueprint.

01:14.060 --> 01:16.060
You become it.

01:16.060 --> 01:19.120
And in that becoming, you don't just lead under pressure.

01:19.120 --> 01:22.180
You rise because of it.

01:22.180 --> 01:24.740
This is where the real you shows up.

01:24.740 --> 01:27.540
That's where the leader you've always been lives.

01:27.540 --> 01:32.260
You're putting in the foundational work that champions are built on.

01:32.260 --> 01:33.260
Keep going.

01:33.260 --> 01:34.740
You've got this.

01:34.740 --> 01:38.020
Now make it happen.

01:38.020 --> 01:41.380
Head to your playbook to complete the drills for this lesson.

01:41.380 --> 01:44.180
And when you're done, mark the lesson complete.

01:44.180 --> 01:46.340
I'll see you back here in the arena.

